    "prompt": "In this image, all directions are relative to the frame. A cartoon style scene featuring a wooden boat, with every butterfly positioned next to it.",
    "dsl": "(and (IsStyle 'cartoon') (exists ?b (and (Is ?b 'boat') (HasMaterial ?b 'wooden') (forall ?f (implies (Is ?f 'butterfly') (NextTo ?f ?b))))))",
